, the social media and blogging platforms hadn't become objectionable enough to make it worthwhile."), mdx("p", null, "Now, things have changed. As Cory Doctorow has mentioned, the \"enshittification\" of big social media platforms is proceeding apace and they're becoming progressively worse all the time. Twitter, though, took a ", mdx("em", {
